// goose-bio: bioinformatics data structures and parsers.
//
// This entry file only names the package. Declare it once in the program's
// root file, then import the modules the program uses:
//
//     import bio from "github.com/sstadick/goose-bio@main";
//     import bio.iitree;
//
// Each module keeps its own namespace: `iitree`, `lapper`, `fastx`, and
// `radix_sort`.
// The entry has no imports of its own, so a program only declares the
// packages that its chosen modules need.
namespace bio;
